WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.025
When your hands are full, who answers the phone?

00:00:03.677 --> 00:00:06.066
Dialogbot takes care of your customers

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:08.470
while you get on with the job.

00:00:09.842 --> 00:00:15.180
Your AI assistant answers questions about your business, your prices and your opening hours.

00:00:15.670 --> 00:00:17.409
You keep your phone number.

00:00:18.874 --> 00:00:20.683
A customer wants a quote?

00:00:21.161 --> 00:00:24.422
Dialogbot finds a free slot in your calendar,

00:00:24.888 --> 00:00:27.951
books the visit and sends a text confirmation.

00:00:29.160 --> 00:00:31.585
The same assistant helps out on your website.

00:00:31.993 --> 00:00:36.543
And with customer consent, you can run call campaigns.

00:00:36.928 --> 00:00:39.782
You approve the list, the script and the price first.

00:00:41.154 --> 00:00:43.694
You decide what it can say and do.

00:00:44.230 --> 00:00:47.340
Just type: We're closed on Friday.

00:00:47.783 --> 00:00:49.732
Review the change, and approve.

00:00:50.151 --> 00:00:52.414
If it's unsure, it takes a message.

00:00:53.762 --> 00:00:56.977
See calls, appointments and messages on your phone.

00:00:57.385 --> 00:00:59.345
Get a daily summary by email.

00:00:59.834 --> 00:01:02.956
Less admin. More time for your customers.

00:01:04.153 --> 00:01:05.939
Get started in three steps:

00:01:06.348 --> 00:01:09.771
Your business. Your calendar. Test and switch on.

00:01:10.156 --> 00:01:13.126
Want a hand? We'll help you set it up.

00:01:14.475 --> 00:01:16.273
Try Dialogbot for yourself.

00:01:16.843 --> 00:01:19.047
Hear how it greets your customers.

00:01:19.549 --> 00:01:23.610
Choose your plan and get started at dialogbot.app.
